{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>蘋果最新iPhone 18系列於香港時間9月10日凌晨正式在發表會上公開亮相，隨後蘋果在官方社群上再公開另一個驚喜，BLACKPINK成員Rosé手拿iPhone 18 Pro 勃根地紅自拍，而她的最新單曲《New Trick》MV就是使用iPhone 18 Pro拍攝。</p><p>當蘋果在社群公開Rosé拿著iPhone 18 Pro照片後，立刻引發果粉及BLINK（BLACKPINK粉絲名）的關注，當大家都在猜測Rosé與蘋果將有什麼合作，蘋果再發文宣告Rosé新單曲《New Trick》MV將於9月17日正式公開，更曝MV是使用iPhone 18 Pro拍攝。這個消息立刻引發網友熱議，紛紛狂問「她是第一個公開拿IPhone18 pro自拍的藝人嗎」。</p><figure><img alt=\"BLACKPINK Rosé（Instagram@roses_are_rosie）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174656729359585280902617.jpeg/dcz6Pjz9wXf5fVIEK1m2sI8O5YMj7t_bGsjBgBrIwYA\"/><figcaption>BLACKPINK Rosé（Instagram@roses_are_rosie）</figcaption></figure><p>更多BLACKPINK Rosé的相片：</p><figure><img alt=\"BLACKPINK Rosé（Instagram@roses_are_rosie）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174658430426681344709321.png/rEW0vtHwZgLLloW9vvDHaI6adgt9qxJiqVcCC6lXAgs\"/><figcaption>BLACKPINK Rosé（Instagram@roses_are_rosie）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BLACKPINK Rosé（Instagram@roses_are_rosie）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174658432716902400879651.png/FYIC5M6EflsErPNyRkh1qmZ_YtRXdsg1oea_haHmv4U\"/><figcaption>BLACKPINK Rosé（Instagram@roses_are_rosie）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BLACKPINK Rosé（Instagram@roses_are_rosie）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174658434931625984169478.jpeg/xUEHbFi6ySBTPeEw3DilNvVOVvDs2ZRlir-B8oq_gfI\"/><figcaption>BLACKPINK Rosé（Instagram@roses_are_rosie）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BLACKPINK Rosé（IG@roses_are_rosie）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171847244119674880426701.jpeg/3JVkF9j8JbrBnn1ZL-Cb5aqzH9gpm6kEELz78hC8-_I\"/><figcaption>BLACKPINK Rosé（IG@roses_are_rosie）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BLACKPINK Rosé與Bruno Mars合作《APT.》全球爆紅。（IG@roses_are_rosie）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171847246305038336698571.jpeg/jPBBnRwlWEcnYZB4urQl1nfytYOGy7FBZTEfKGUxHyg\"/><figcaption>BLACKPINK Rosé與Bruno Mars合作《APT.》全球爆紅。（IG@roses_are_rosie）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BLACKPINK Rosé（IG@roses_are_rosie）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171847239597953024254601.jpeg/veF6BebK57HkQEi9K8K-yEGd6oTk3QgQRPGo-ETxqPg\"/><figcaption>BLACKPINK Rosé（IG@roses_are_rosie）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BLACKPINK Rosé（IG@roses_are_rosie）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171847242076917760257601.jpeg/mmd6-EXeG4lXNBHpJZAYxuW3fBmytWh2Yorb0WKK29E\"/><figcaption>BLACKPINK Rosé（IG@roses_are_rosie）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BLACKPINK Rosé（IG@roses_are_rosie）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171847237303537664052846.jpeg/-Y8tjHok92jOf8h9-nIkILzS6m_GDclFbM8frWzPH60\"/><figcaption>BLACKPINK Rosé（IG@roses_are_rosie）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BLACKPINK Rosé（IG@roses_are_rosie）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171847233893568512245037.jpeg/2AZNinHnftgyciw1M67gZ-9DXgeCSpM0sJvjC7Cb4ws\"/><figcaption>BLACKPINK Rosé（IG@roses_are_rosie）</figcaption></figure><p>Rosé在接受《VOGUE》訪問時透露，新歌《New Trick》是今年參加完大都會博物館慈善晚宴後兩天寫成的，至於個人第二張專輯的進度，她也坦言粉絲可能要等2027年才能聽到，也表示花了很長的時間在創作音樂上，明年大家可以聽到她的音樂帶來的新時代。</p><p>這次《New Trick》MV導演是之前合作過《JUMP》的Dave Meyers，還首次與蘋果合作宣傳，應使用最新iPhone 18 Pro，成功製作一波話題熱度。</p><figure><img alt=\"BLACKPINK出道10周年。（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166439311134953472514093.jpeg/g8yggpMLY1z2hkkRrcZiTZXOC75Z7PjbhyIynIciMpw\"/><figcaption>BLACKPINK出道10周年。（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BLACKPINK 10周年（Instagram@roses_are_rosie）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260809/1163121630218555392732965.jpeg/iHugYy5bem17y8f4juwb867pM2_6DCaKLvFU3i7xVN4\"/><figcaption>BLACKPINK 10周年（Instagram@roses_are_rosie）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BLACKPINK十周年活動被指寒酸。（Weverse直播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166432778343288832214593.png/0xcqMEUpUgFUke6sDH2i2E2BKeFTHeg5uuTSH7rk0h8\"/><figcaption>BLACKPINK十周年活動被指寒酸。（Weverse直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BLACKPINK十周年直播。（Weverse直播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166432775948210176687351.png/x0reqbOltikiCoM58opb0l4ZjEkCGPNDcJy-j3Ccvo8\"/><figcaption>BLACKPINK十周年直播。（Weverse直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Rosé為成員準備蛋糕和鮮花。（Weverse直播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166432773242753024138609.png/Ysji5zBubYSSXsKa3KOrqiklrUQ_UPxG2einsdnop7E\"/><figcaption>Rosé為成員準備蛋糕和鮮花。（Weverse直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BLACKPINK十周年直播僅11分鐘。（Weverse直播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166432770889617408207915.png/2XDd5zHRFZ8MyCVGgQ7AGj7Bcku6GZ0iDRWRyg0Vkco\"/><figcaption>BLACKPINK十周年直播僅11分鐘。（Weverse直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BLACKPINK十周年見面會在博物館舉行。（Weverse圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166434177579749376659708.jpeg/-mZNe0TN3ZqZBkcMTzP3qB1OslUgPvIKGPnCGxj5whs\"/><figcaption>BLACKPINK十周年見面會在博物館舉行。（Weverse圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"僅得40名粉絲參加。（Weverse圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166434172286406656215479.jpeg/i0YK_Ln5TnaKo2hKSAv8doiG_nJvCaPLqscaaKrHGmg\"/><figcaption>僅得40名粉絲參加。（Weverse圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BLACKPINK（Weverse圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166434169559977984769230.jpeg/KLkMpTf2rpnwl3Lv5o60KEzpP1Fj-0c99fSc2PX0nNg\"/><figcaption>BLACKPINK（Weverse圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BLACKPINK四人相繼發文道歉。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166428376723230720735861.jpeg/iJgqGwd5Xvs3pNHB-vnXUYFzZV5GtzVkBdjXswXY17M\"/><figcaption>BLACKPINK四人相繼發文道歉。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BLACKPINK四人相繼發文道歉。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166428374437203968419560.jpeg/ldAKSuVx3R4TOCYXcq9KvzpLw35YtJjZCokzMwqJMzM\"/><figcaption>BLACKPINK四人相繼發文道歉。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BLACKPINK四人相繼發文道歉。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166428372193120256569803.jpeg/6CqfVL8GEko3_JhNFCTIBqjUsnh-Wr9NoqzRBaKs0QU\"/><figcaption>BLACKPINK四人相繼發文道歉。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BLACKPINK四人相繼發文道歉。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166428369944842240905731.jpeg/ywlDypJTCLcuutiZJqshqfRk273mN4J9ox50g6MedIM\"/><figcaption>BLACKPINK四人相繼發文道歉。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>林曉培等了5年宣布「有伴了」！親曝新歡身分 為「她」徹底變一個人</p><p>子瑜爆單飛母發聲了！傳年底約滿親友爆內亂 媽媽IG親開砲</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-10T04:39:20.157128+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1418,"images":23,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}